  "food": {
    "title": "Food near Cap des Trois Fourches",
    "p1": "Services on the peninsula are limited — pack a full picnic and water, then eat a proper meal back in Nador or at a coastal stop on the return.",
    "li1": "Bring sandwiches, fruit and extra water.",
    "li2": "Do not count on restaurants at every viewpoint.",
    "li3": "A late seafood dinner on the corniche works after the drive back.",
    "li4": "Stock up in town before leaving Nador.",
    "li5": "If a roadside café is open, confirm prices first.",
    "p2": "Self-sufficient packing is the rule for a full Cap day."
  },
